  "purpose": [
    "Mnemion gives people and their AI agents shared, evolving memory. People use a live browser workspace while agents use MCP. The browser and other HTTP clients pass through Routing; both access paths reach one Hive, which owns data and enforces read and write boundaries. Shared declarations give agents and browser renderers the same UI vocabulary."
